error[3-0061]: `StorageMap<u256, u256>` is state-only
   ┌─ view_consts.fe:32:12
   │
32 │ const MAP: StorageMap<u256, u256> = StorageMap {}
   │            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a state-only type cannot be the type of a `const`
